5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. To ensure our next investment truly serves the campus, I would like to examine the post-occupancy review ratings and the survey findings in the older blocks.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I agree that understanding the actual utility of our spaces is essential. To complement that, I would like to examine the booking data for specialist and general rooms and the timetable records on rooms out of service.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A most prudent start, Victoria. To ensure our ambitions are not merely fantasies, I shall examine the tender records over three budget cycles and the decade of delivery schedules by project rationale. Logic suggests the past is a reliable mirror.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to be here! I want to make sure we're being honest about the money, so I'll look into the renewal reserve for equipment bought earlier and the tender records over three budget cycles!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,It seems we have the data-driven side of things well-covered. I'll take a look at the staffing posts since the hiring freeze and the bench technicians' weekly manual routines. Let's see who is actually doing the work.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"It seems we have a very comprehensive plan. By combining the user experience data I'm seeking with the operational and financial records you've all chosen, we should avoid any blind spots in our decision.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I concur. A multifaceted approach is the only way to ensure we don't overlook the practical impact on our daily operations. I look forward to seeing how these different data points intersect.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. A symphony of data is far more illuminating than a single note. I suspect we shall find that the gap between our aspirations and our achievements is wider than the administration cares to admit.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I totally agree! It's going to be like a big puzzle, and I can't wait to see how all the pieces fit together. Let's find a plan that actually works for everyone!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"A puzzle is a charming way to put it, Kenji. I just hope the pieces we find aren't too broken to fit. I'll be interested to see if the ""aspirations"" Benjamin mentioned actually account for the people involved.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shunichi, that is a vital point. The human element is often the first thing lost in a spreadsheet. I believe our combined findings will reveal whether our past projects actually supported the people using them.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Mizuki, I agree. It is easy to focus on the final result while ignoring the friction caused during the process. I hope the records show how our schedules have actually absorbed these changes.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Victoria, your mention of friction is most apt. I suspect the records will reveal a recurring tragedy where optimistic timelines are systematically dismantled by the reality of unforeseen costs. It is a dance we perform every fiscal year.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, that sounds a bit sad! But that's why we're doing this, right? To stop the tragedy! I'm sure if we all work together, we can find a way to make the numbers actually match the real world!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Kenji, your optimism is almost enviable. However, working together is only useful if we're willing to face the actual mess. I'm curious to see if the ""real world"" includes the people currently keeping this place running.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I believe we have reached a consensus on our areas of investigation. Let us proceed to the findings with an open mind and a commitment to the truth. I am ready to see the results.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I agree. We have a clear division of labor and a comprehensive set of data to analyze. I am ready to proceed to the findings and see what the records reveal.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Quite. Since we have mapped our intellectual territory with such elegance, I shall also declare myself ready. Let us see if the archives are as cooperative as our conversation has been.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm ready too! I can't wait to see what we find out. Let's all do our best to pick a project that's actually possible! See you all in the next round!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I'm ready as well. Let's hope the data provides something more substantial than the usual administrative optimism. I look forward to seeing where the cracks are.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
26,1,4,pass,Shunichi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
